{"c":[{"name":"20260923T175126Z-b6b0ec4afd3fbaa0","text":"choose-verification-model: trailing -fast shares the base catalog row; rank on the base price; append -fast only when the author was fast and the chosen model has a fast variant.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T214304Z-c05ae22638162f06","text":"choose-verification-model: cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh is tier A, family grok, has_fast. Live slugs claude-opus-5-5-high and grok-4.7-xhigh are still unknown; catalog has claude-opus-5-5-medium and grok-4.7-high.","type":"note"}]}
